            {"label": "SWUFT acquisition Apr 2024", "value": "Wye Valley acquired by South Warwickshire NHS FT to form South Warwickshire University NHS FT — PFI hand-back planning now under SWUFT board"},
            {"label": "Estate covered", "value": "Hereford County Hospital — main acute site (c. 250 beds, opened Aug 2002)"},
